Third-party code
----------------

MyPosLab is built on NexoPOS, which is also licensed under the GNU General
Public License v3.0.

  Original project : NexoPOS
  Copyright        : Blair2004 (https://github.com/Blair2004) and contributors
  Source           : https://github.com/Blair2004/NexoPOS
  Based on commit  : 053cea2 (imported 2026-11-24)

MyPosLab changes include the new name, logo and icons, the "Sadu Light"
user interface, and six new modules (UAE e-invoicing, WhatsApp receipts,
batches and expiry, customer display, owner app, branches). Internal
identifiers such as database table names (nexopos_*), permission names
(nexopos.*), API routes (api/nexopos/v4) and the config file
(config/nexopos.php) are kept unchanged so that existing databases and
modules remain compatible.

